
     Among the many features of the GamBit Multi System are:

        o A state-of-the-art minicomputer with eight dial-up
          ports and one megabyte of memory. (Expandable to
          sixteen dial-up ports.)

        o A sophisticated UNIX-type operating system.

        o A wide range of applications software, including:

          1. Bulletin-board message service.
          2. Private user-user mail.
          3. "Conference" facility for talking with
             with up to sixteen other users.
          4. The Diplomacy game - a simulation of World
             War I European diplomacy.
          5. The Scepter of Goth Milieu: This is the popular
             medieval role-play game, scaled down from its
             original 40-player version.  (As played on the
             MECC timeshare system.)

     The GamBit Multi System is designed to give you the
maximum enjoyment for your gaming dollar.
